      ],
      "answer": "c",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(\\dfrac{1}{1-i}=\\dfrac{1+i}{2}\\)\nবাস্তব সহগের সমীকরণে অপর মূল অনুবন্ধি, \\(\\dfrac{1-i}{2}=\\dfrac12(-i+1)\\)",
