          "text": "\\(x^2 - 3x + \\sqrt{2} = 0\\)",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "d",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(\\alpha+\\beta=-\\dfrac{3}{\\sqrt2},\\ \\alpha\\beta=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\)\nনতুন মূলের যোগফল \\(=\\dfrac{\\alpha+\\beta}{\\alpha\\beta}=-3\\), গুণফল \\(=\\dfrac1{\\alpha\\beta}=\\sqrt2\\)\nসমীকরণ: \\(x^2+3x+\\sqrt2=0\\), যা (গ)।",
      "source": {
        "board": "DB",
        "year": "2023",
        "qno": 20,
        "session": null
      },
